WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.135
Sẽn sɩng ne yʋʋm kobs-kãense, sa-kãsengã ra pa saag ye.

00:00:05.215 --> 00:00:13.953
Zĩis nins b sẽn dag n tigsdẽ wã ra pa tar pãng ye, la b pʋgã ra kelemdd ne pãng n yɩɩd tãmbã.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:21.159
Zĩigã ra baoodame n na n dɩtẽ, a tʋb sẽn yaa kãenkãe la a nao-bõonegã yĩnga.

00:00:21.239 --> 00:00:25.616
Baa a sẽn wa n dɩtẽ, kom da ket n namsd-a lame.
